                            ╔═ deploy ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗                            
                            ║ ⚠ Deploy demo-stack?                                         ║                            
                            ║                                                              ║                            
                            ║ Starts a run at once: a stack with backup rules is stopped   ║                            
                            ║ and backed up first, then it pulls, starts and checks the    ║                            
                            ║ stack, and rolls back if a step fails. Without backup rules  ║                            
                            ║ the stack keeps running and only changed containers are      ║                            
                            ║ recreated.                                                   ║                            
                            ║ $ sudo qhost stack deploy --output json -- demo-stack        ║                            
                            ║                                                              ║                            
                            ║ [ yes, with sudo ]  [ enter cancel ]                         ║                            
                            ║ y yes, with sudo  n/esc/enter cancel                         ║                            
